              "value": "(conjuration, primal, water)\n\nWhen a grodair dies, its body explodes in a blast of pressurized water that deals 4d6 bludgeoning damage to creatures within a 15-foot emanation (22 basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its save is pushed 5 feet (or 10 feet on a critical failure)."
